{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8e3d0f2-5c4e-5d7f-a011-purchase-orders",
    "name": "Spendesk API — Purchase Orders",
    "description": "Endpoints PO (Public API) : liste, détail, création, annulation, clôture.\n\n**Scopes** : `experimental:purchase-order:read` + `experimental:purchase-order:write` ; pour le dossier *Discovery* : `user:read`, `cost-center:read`, `supplier:read`, `analytical-field:read`.\n\n1. Importer l’environnement (`base_url`, `client_id`, `client_secret`).\n2. **01 Auth**.\n3. Dossier **02 Discovery** (remplit `po_user_id`, `po_cost_center_id`, `po_supplier_id`, `po_analytical_field_id`, `po_analytical_value_id`).\n4. **03 Liste** → enregistre `po_id` (1er PO de la page).\n5. **04 Get by ID** (lecture).\n6. **05 Create PO** → enregistre `po_id_last_created` si 201.\n7. **06 Cancel** / **07 Close** : utiliser `{{po_id_cancel}}` et `{{po_id_close}}` (deux OP **ouverts** jetables), ou `{{po_id_last_created}}` après une création réussie (ne pas fermer le même OP deux fois).\n\nVoir `postman/README.md` section Purchase Orders.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Auth — Client credentials",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const code = pm.response.code;",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Token OK (200)', function () { pm.expect(code).to.eql(200); });",
              "if (j.access_token) {",
              "  pm.environment.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access_token);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "auth": {
          "type": "basic",
          "basic": [
            { "key": "username", "value": "{{client_id}}", "type": "string" },
            { "key": "password", "value": "{{client_secret}}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/token"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Discovery — IDs for Create PO",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Users (save po_user_id)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const rows = j.data || j.users || [];",
                  "if (rows[0]?.id) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('po_user_id', rows[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('po_user_id=', rows[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/users?page=1&per_page=30"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
